      "title": "HCP Plastene Bulkpack Limited Announces Resignation of Shweta Jhawar as Company Secretary and Compliance Officer, Effective January 8, 2026",
      "body": "HCP Plastene Bulkpack Limited announced that Ms. Shweta Jhawar, Company Secretary and Compliance Officer of the Company, has tendered her resignation vide email dated January 9, 2026, from the post of Company Secretary and Compliance Officer with effect from January 8, 2026. The resignation has been accepted by the Company, and she has been relieved from her duties as Company Secretary and Compliance Officer with effect from the close of business hours on January 8, 2026. Ms. Jhawar cited professional engagements and internal company matters that require further clarification as reasons for her resignation.",
